```markdown
# Changelog - Hope for All Foundation Website

All development updates, bug fixes, and lecturer feedback adjustments are recorded below.

## [2.0.0] - Part 2 Release - 2026-09-18
### Added
- **External CSS Architecture (`css/style.css`):** Built centralized stylesheet linked across all 6 pages (`index.html`, `aboutus.html`, `menu.html`, `events.html`, `enquiry.html`, `contact.html`).
- **CSS Reset & Design Tokens:** Included universal box-sizing reset and `:root` variables for brand colors (`#1b4332`, `#d97706`), spacing, and typography.
- **Layout Systems:** Implemented multi-column CSS Grid and Flexbox systems for card layouts, hero sections, and footers.
- **Interactive Pseudo-Classes:** Applied `:hover`, `:focus`, `:active`, and `:nth-child` dynamic visual indicators on interactive buttons, cards, and inputs.
- **Responsive Media Query Breakpoints:** Configured layout adjustments for Desktop (>1024px), Tablet (768px - 1023px), and Mobile (<767px).
- **Responsive Images:** Added `srcset`, `sizes`, and `<picture>` tags to optimize media rendering across resolutions.

### Changed
- **Lecturer Feedback Edits:** Normalized path links across root and subpages. Removed residual inline attributes in favor of external CSS classes.

## [1.2.0] - 2026-08-12
### Added
- Integrated high-resolution Unsplash imagery across all pages[span_5](start_span)[span_5](end_span).
- Embedded location map on `contact.html`[span_6](start_span)[span_6](end_span).

## [1.1.0] - 2026-08-10
### Added
- Built structured form fields on `enquiry.html` for volunteer sign-ups[span_7](start_span)[span_7](end_span).
- Added mission, vision, and team member sections on `aboutus.html`[span_8](start_span)[span_8](end_span).

## [1.0.0] - 2026-08-05
### Added
- Initialized repository with basic HTML structure and navigation layout across all pages[span_9](start_span)[span_9](end_span).